\newlabel{tab:temporal_rates}{{2}{6}{Illicit rate and node counts per test time step. Steps 35--42 maintain a rate broadly comparable to training and support reasonable model performance. Steps 43--49 fall to near-zero fraud rates, causing complete model collapse. Step 49 partially recovers as fraud activity briefly resumes}{table.caption.3}{}}
